and responsiveness. Each thread is a lightweight, independent unit of execution that shares the same memory space as other threads within the same process. ',70,'MEDIUM','2026-01-16 14:29:56.511430',72,33.75,13,15,'NEUTRAL'),(240,90,'The main difference is thread safety: HashMap is not thread-safe (faster, single-threaded use), while ConcurrentHashMap is thread-safe (slower, multi-threaded use) but handles concurrent modifications gracefully without ConcurrentModificationException, using fine-grained locking (segmentation/striping) instead of locking the whole map, allowing better concurrency than older synchronized maps. HashMap allows one null key/values, but ConcurrentHashMap does not allow any null keys or values.',85,'HIGH','2026-01-16 14:30:02.149584',72,90,3,95,'POSITIVE'),(241,20,'\"Collections in Java\" refers to the Java Collections Framework (JCF), a unified architecture within the java.util package designed to store and manipulate groups of objects efficiently. The framework provides a set of interfaces, implementation classes, and algorithms to manage data without needing to write custom data structures from scratch. ',70,'MEDIUM','2026-01-16 14:30:06.933245',72,30,11,10,'NEUTRAL'),(242,0,'sdd',10,'LOW','2026-01-16 14:35:28.041302',73,2,4,0,'NEGATIVE'),(243,0,'df',10,'LOW','2026-01-16 14:35:31.510278',73,2,10,0,'NEGATIVE'),(244,0,'df',10,'LOW','2026-01-16 14:35:36.787246',73,2,5,0,'NEGATIVE'),(245,0,'dz',10,'LOW','2026-01-16 14:35:40.946668',73,2,12,0,'NEGATIVE'),(246,0,'zsd',10,'LOW','2026-01-16 14:35:46.080789',73,2,2,0,'NEGATIVE'),(247,40,' JVM means Java Virtual Machine which helps the program to run on any environment',60,'MEDIUM','2026-01-16 15:01:53.868857',74,50,4,50,'NEUTRAL'),(248,20,' exception handling is a very powerful tool of Java which  checks the runtime exceptions',40,'LOW','2026-01-16 15:01:57.121228',74,30,12,30,'NEUTRAL'),(249,0,' no idea',10,'LOW','2026-01-16 15:02:00.683050',74,2,3,0,'NEGATIVE'),(250,10,' marketing helps the progr